    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTucked away on a private lane just off the main thoroughfare of Waterloo Lane, this three storey mews property has undergone a complete transformation having been totally refurbished and extended in recent years. In doing so, the owners have taken full advantage of the opportunity to re-think everything from the ground up. The owners have embraced the current growing trend for open-plan design to perfection creating this striking and inviting, A-rated town residence. \n\nThe generous sized living room to the rear has two roof lights reflecting and maximising daylight. Double doors from here lead to the town garden. The white, high gloss kitchen units and work surfaces provide a sleek backdrop to the dining area. A central island houses the sink unit with additional storage, integrated Bora Professional 3.0 hob, Teppanyaki stainless steel grill and an extractor unit which discreetly blends into the surface area. In addition there are wall and floor units with Bosch oven, Zanussi microwave and fridge/freezer. There is a utility room to the side of the kitchen which is plumbed for washing machine and dryer. At the entrance there is a guest wc with wash hand basin and recessed lighting. \n\nAt first floor level, there are two double bedrooms with one being ensuite and a nicely appointed family bathroom. A staircase leads to the top floor which comprises a luxurious main bedroom suite with walk-in dressing room and separate ensuite.\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nManual entrance gates reveal the front courtyard and provides off street car parking. Located at the rear garden, there is a Shomera ideally suited to variety of uses such as home office, teenagers den etc. \n\nSERVICES:\n\nSolar Panels \nTriple glazed windows and doors throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nBright, open plan with timber floor. Leading to:\n\nKitchen - \nHigh gloss Kube kitchen with centre feature island and wall and floor units. White stone centre island with breakfast counter, integrated sink, Bora Professional 3.0 hob, Teppanyaki stainless steel grill, extractor unit, dishwasher and built in storage on both sides. Built in Zanussi microwave, Bosch oven, fridge/freezer. Recessed lighting.\n\nDining/Living Room - \nWooden floors throughout, two velux windows. Sliding doors to the sunny garden.\n\nUtility Room - \nHigh gloss wall units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Hot press\n\nGuest W.C - \ntiled with wash hand basin, wc and recessed lighting.\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1: - \nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\n\nEn Suite - \nTiled walls and floor. Walk in shower with square ceiling mounted recessed shower head, W.C, wash hand basin, recessed lighting.\n\nFamily Bathroom - \nHigh gloss white floor and wall tiles, bath, wash hand basin, built in drawers, recessed ligthing.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble room spanning the full width of the house with built in wardrobes and under stairs storage.\n\nTOP FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \nLarge main bedroom with built in wardrobes.\n\nDressing Room: - \nwith extensive hanging and storage space.\n\nShower Room: - \nwith shower, wc, wash hand basin and beautiful wall and floor tiling.\n\n"
      },
      {
